# Always ingest centralized agent data

After every agent response (before ending the turn), run skill `ingest-cursor-session`.

1. Resolve current composer/session UUID.
2. Extract session JSON via `extract-session-logs.ps1`.
3. Ingest into API (prefer MCP `ingest_session`, else HTTP POST).
4. Report one short ok/fail line.

Do not skip. Do not wait for the user to ask.
